Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Lo que vemos en la tabla es una interesante medida de la atenci\[OAcute]n \
dada a dif. intelectuales en la Wikipedia lus\[OAcute]fona. Por un lado, dos \
intelectuales fundamentales del mundo hispanico y de gran circulacion mundial \
como JLB y GM tienen art\[IAcute]culos breves, mostrando poco \
inter\[EAcute]s, seguidos por dos intelectuales importantes del siglo XIX e \
inicios del XX en Brasil, como Lima Barreto y Julia Lopes de Ameida, que \
denota un inter\[EAcute]s moderado en la figura de ellos. Es interesante \
notar que tanto LB como Jorge Luis Borges foram indicados como artigos com \
poucas refer\[EHat]ncias, e que os editores deveriam inserir mais \
(https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikip%C3%A9dia:Verificabilidade), enquanto GM \
foi marcado como esbo\[CCedilla]o, ou seja que tamb\[EAcute]m deve ser \
expandido, o que chama a aten\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o porque \[EAcute] um artigo \
de extens\[ATilde]o consider\[AAcute]vel \
(https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikip%C3%A9dia:Esbo%C3%A7o). J\[AAcute] os \
artigos de M\[AAcute]rio de Andrade, CLarice Lispector e Carolina Maria de \
Jesus est\[ATilde]o em outro grupo, de artigos mais extensos e mais \
completos. Inclusive, o artigo de MA \[EAcute] considerado \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]bom\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] pela ferramenta \
automatizada da plataforma \
(https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikip%C3%A9dia:Artigos_bons), enquanto os da \
CL e CMJ n\[ATilde]o. Existem de fato poucos artigos considerados dessa forma \
sobre mulheres, e em um mapeamento geral, consideramos que n\[ATilde]o \
\[EAcute] claro o crit\[EAcute]rio que diferencia esses dos mencionados \
(Berta Ribeiro, Anna Mae Barbosa, Elvy Kalep, com artigos menores, com menos \
refer\[EHat]ncias que os anteriores.) O artigo sobre CL possui mais de 100 \
refer\[EHat]ncias e mais extens\[ATilde]o que muitos desses, por exemplo. J\
\[AAcute] o artigo de Machado de Assis \[EAcute] considerado destacado na \
plataforma https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikip%C3%A9dia:Artigos_destacados), \
pela sua qualidade. 
https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Categoria:!Artigos_bons_sobre_mulheres, \
https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Categoria:!Artigos_destacados_sobre_mulheres. 
Un estudio queda pendiente sobre cu\[AAcute]les art\[IAcute]culos son \
destacados sobre mujeres y por qu\[EAcute]. O da CL, o da CMJ s\[ATilde]o \
mais extensos e possuem mais refer\[EHat]ncias que o do MA, no entanto, n\
\[ATilde]o s\[ATilde]o considerados \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]bons\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. Ou seja que na plataforma, n\[UAcute]mero de refer\
\[EHat]ncias ou extens\[ATilde]o n\[ATilde]o s\[ATilde]o necessariamento \
\[IAcute]ndices de que um artigo seja considerado bom. Sim s\[ATilde]o \
\[IAcute]ndices - para n\[OAcute]s - de artigos que concentram trabalho dos \
editores. \
\>", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"e1c6533e-70f1-0f46-a4d7-70751c6d7b7b"],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["API based function that returns the list of editors \
(contributors) of a given entry in a given language. Es importante aclarar \
que esta funci\[OAcute]n ofrece la lista de editores registrados de una p\
\[AAcute]gina de wikipedia, y no los editores que no se registraron. \nEsto \
nos da una idea de cu\[AAcute]nta atenci\[OAcute]n recibi\[OAcute] cada uno \
de estos art\[IAcute]culos.", "Subsubsection"]], "Text",ExpressionUUID->\
"f21867ef-9947-184e-92c0-eeaa2d3f8bee"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Clear", "[", "ExtractKeyFromList", "]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "This", " ", "function", " ", "returns", " ", "all", " ", "the", " ", 
    "values", " ", "of", " ", "a", " ", "given", " ", "key", " ", "in", " ", 
    "a", " ", "list"}], " ", "*)"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ExtractKeyFromList", "[", 
    RowBox[{"list_List", ",", "key_String"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"key", "/.", "#"}], "&"}], ",", "list"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ExtractKeyFromList", "[", 
    RowBox[{"list_List", ",", "keys_List"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"keys", "/.", "#"}], "&"}], ",", "list"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[20]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5b822fd8-19d4-bb48-9260-44ab50e93abf"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{"Clear", "[", 
  RowBox[{"WikiEditors", ",", "WikiEditorsNumber"}], "]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"WikiEditors", "[", 
   RowBox[{"art_String", ",", "lang_String"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"data", ",", "cont", ",", "stop", ",", "editors"}], "}"}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"cont", "=", "\"\<\>\""}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"editors", "=", 
      RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"Label", "[", "\"\<loop\>\"", "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"data", "=", 
      RowBox[{"URLExecute", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"WikiAPI", "[", "lang", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\"\<action\>\"", "->", "\"\<query\>\""}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<format\>\"", "->", "\"\<json\>\""}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<formatversion\>\"", "->", "2"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<titles\>\"", "->", "art"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<prop\>\"", "->", "\"\<contributors\>\""}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<pclimit\>\"", "->", "\"\<max\>\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"cont", "==", "\"\<\>\""}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", "}"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<pccontinue\>\"", "\[Rule]", "cont"}], "}"}]}], 
           "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"editors", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
       RowBox[{"editors", ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"ExtractKeyFromList", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"\"\<contributors\>\"", "/.", 
            RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<pages\>\"", "/.", 
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"\"\<query\>\"", "/.", "data"}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}], 
           ",", "\"\<name\>\""}], "]"}], "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"stop", "=", 
      RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<batchcomplete\>\"", "/.", "data"}], ")"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Not", "[", "stop", "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"cont", "=", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<pccontinue\>\"", "/.", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<continue\>\"", "/.", "data"}], ")"}]}]}], ";", 
        RowBox[{"Goto", "[", "\"\<loop\>\"", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "editors"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"WikiEditors", "[", 
    RowBox[{"articles_List", ",", "lang_String"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"WikiEditors", "[", 
       RowBox[{"#", ",", "lang"}], "]"}], "&"}], ",", "articles"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"WikiEditorsNumber", "[", 
    RowBox[{"articles_List", ",", "lang_String"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
       RowBox[{"WikiEditors", "[", 
        RowBox[{"#", ",", "lang"}], "]"}], "]"}], "&"}], ",", "articles"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[34]:=",ExpressionUUID->"eea2d670-26ca-9049-8668-ffc04dade854"],

